Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `r` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/move_from_borrowed_field.jet:21:14
    |
 21 |     taken := r.session.move()
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Read and write parameters and named windows keep ownership with their source
 Fix: Copy the value with `r.copy()`, or declare the parameter `r: &&Root` to take ownership
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

